# Play test of Balboa Remade (CIPlay balboa_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the rangers'
# station on the east terrace (5 m), the den's mouth on the west plateau facing east (8.9 m), the summit (50 m).
# Quest "The Rangers' Last Call", 20 steps: station (1-9), den (10-15), summit (16-19), the strongbox (20).
island Balboa Remade
expect step 0
expect title The Rangers' Last Call

# Up from the east beach to the station: the flag post, the logbook, the crates round the shack, the machete, the
# ration box and the woodpile - seven pages
at 110 3
walk 110 3 to 100 3 to 93 4 h=5
zone station
expect step 1
read Flag post
expect step 2
read Ranger's logbook
expect step 3
open Crate under the window
expect step 4
open Rangers' supply crate
expect step 5
open Tool locker
expect story machete 1
wait 2
expect step 7
open Rangers' ration box
expect step 8
open Woodpile
wait 2
expect step 9

# The strongbox stays shut without its key
open Ranger's strongbox
expect message The strongbox is locked
expect step 9

# The den on the west plateau: the warning sign, the vines over the barricade cut with the machete, in to the Mama bear
at -52 -9.5
walk -52 -9.5 to -62 -9.5 h=8.9
read Warning sign
expect step 10
use vinewall
expect message machete bites
expect hidden vinewall
# (to the mouth, then in: Balboa's cave rock has a low ridge across its floor 1.3 m inside the mouth that the walker
# sticks on now and then (a player steps or jumps over it); CIRaySlice shows it - SL6 plan run, 2026-10-19)
walk -62 -9.5 to -67.8 -9.5
at -69.5 -9.5 h=6.6
walk -69.5 -9.5 to -78 -9.5
zone den
expect step 11
read Scrawled on a crate
expect step 12
kill Bear
expect step 13
open Hendricks' pack
expect story stationkey 1
wait 2
expect step 15

# The summit: the plate on the mast, the spare parts box, the radio called, its desk opened
at 26 -18
walk 26 -18 to 22 -17 h=50
zone summit
expect step 16
read Mast plate
expect step 17
open Spare parts box
expect step 18
open Radio desk
expect message Call out first
expect step 18
use mastradio
expect message We hear you
open Radio desk
expect step 19

# Back at the station: the strongbox on the terrace north of the shack
at 82 15
expect step 19
open Ranger's strongbox
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect item Blueprint_Fueltank 1
expect done
